# 🚀 MidSize AI Roofing - Master Workspace

Welcome to the central tech repository for **MidSize AI Roofing** and the **Honest Roofer Podcast**. This workspace handles our customer-facing marketing hub, automated voice agent documentation, and content pipelines.

