## 🗂️ Repository Architecture

This workspace is strictly organized to keep our marketing site, AI scripts, and media content separated and scalable:

```text
midsizeai/
│
├── .github/                 # Project tracking & workflow task templates
│
├── website/                 # Core front-end website files
│   ├── index.html           # Main landing page for MidSize AI Roofing
│   ├── CSS/                 # Custom layout styling (style.css)
│   ├── JS/                  # Dynamic button logic & widget triggers (main.js)
│   └── honest-roofer/       # Listener landing page for the podcast (index.html)
│
├── ai-agents/               # Samantha AI configuration scripts
│   ├── samantha_prompt.md   # Version-controlled master prompt & roleplay logic
│   └── crm_mappings.json    # Data blueprint for Jobber & Housecall Pro push
│
└── podcast-hub/             # Content marketing & lead generation pipeline
    ├── guest-backlog.md     # Roofer vetting pipeline (Replied "GUEST")
    ├── episode-notes/       # Production outlines & homeowner education notes
    └── assets/              # Short-form video scripts (YouTube/TikTok)
